physicalRef: utility_links
description: "Electricity revenue-protection Link Analysis showcase - ONE link Dataset built by the utility_links Job from premise, customer_account, meter_read, payment, field_visit, service_order and prepaid_vend. kind is one of supplied_by, account_at, paid_from, visited_by, order_closed_by, vended_by; one row per pair; via names the evidence. Ids say what an endpoint is: PRM- premise, TX- transformer, ACC- account, BA- bank account, C- contractor, V- vending point. Synthetic."
eventDate: event_date
